// What each translation in `../ja.ron` of English that lives in definitions (titles,
// descriptions, guide lines, help) was made from: by the same keys, the English and the
// Japanese written for it. When a definition's English changes, a guide line is inserted
// (shifting the keys after it) or the Japanese changes, the test
// `every_translation_follows_its_english` names it: check the Japanese follows the
// English, then set both here. A mod pins its own translations beside them.
